      "comment": "PRINCESS DIAMOND (8) added to the impressive sequence of wins last start when she scored by 6 metres over 2130m at this track as the $1.55 favourite after raced three-wide early and then led at the bell. The driver has some work to do from this wide starting position. Meets a comparable field so she is capable of getting the job done again. BULL SHARK BETTY (5) drew a wide gate last start and was never a genuine threat, beaten 21 metres into 11th at Pinjarra over 2185m after racing three-wide without cover at the bell. Meets a similar line up and she can figure in the finish. EYE BETTER (7) must be considered after she finished third over 2130m at Central Wheatbelt a couple of days ago. HURRICANEHOPE (3) is in the mix following a fourth at her most recent appearance over 2185m at Pinjarra. Include in exotic bets.",
